sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as CL1 / DL1
    participant M as ML0
    participant A as GL0 admission committee
    participant E as GL0 execution committee
    participant G as GL0 producer
    participant F as GL0 followers

    C->>M: submit framework-economic or custom-data block
    M->>M: metagraph snapshot consensus
    M->>A: signed state-channel binary
    A->>A: per-binary secret VRF admission and authentication
    A->>E: buffer binary in static execution shard
    E->>E: scheduled producer pins finalized execution base
    E->>E: recreate every CL1 transition and compute roots
    E->>E: build and sign checkpoint with roots plus replay inputs
    E->>E: attesters validate and recreate before signing
    E->>G: replay-valid checkpoint
    G->>G: independently verify and recreate every CL1 transition
    G->>G: embed checkpoint in global snapshot
    G->>F: signed global snapshot
    F->>F: independently verify and recreate before adoption
    F-->>M: finalized canonical GL0 state
    F-->>C: finalized canonical GL0 state

    Note over E,F: Quorum selects only among replay-valid checkpoints and never makes economic state valid
